[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4563.51, "timestamp": "01:16:03", "text": "是的。呃，反应视频。那很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4566.55, "timestamp": "01:16:06", "text": "主意。我不知道。这样做好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4569.35, "timestamp": "01:16:09", "text": "反应物含量？我不太擅长……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4571.229, "timestamp": "01:16:11", "text": "反应"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4575.83, "timestamp": "01:16:15", "text": "给予者。嗯，但是反应内容就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4579.55, "timestamp": "01:16:19", "text": "你现在没做什么事。我可能会得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4582.149, "timestamp": "01:16:22", "text": "可能是无聊之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4587.39, "timestamp": "01:16:27", "text": "但是，是的，我的意思是，我可以做到，我可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4593.43, "timestamp": "01:16:33", "text": "试试看，是的，我可以玩游戏，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4596.27, "timestamp": "01:16:36", "text": "因为我在进行多路复现，所以别忘了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4599.83, "timestamp": "01:16:39", "text": "每个人都需要多路复现，对吧？好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4602.229, "timestamp": "01:16:42", "text": "我回来了。不能忘了我的 Twitch 直播间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4604.709, "timestamp": "01:16:44", "text": "familia 和 YouTube familiar。正确的。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4607.11, "timestamp": "01:16:47", "text": "这就是我那天提到的那个GPU的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4611.83, "timestamp": "01:16:51", "text": "我的2060显卡丢了。这就是我进行扩音的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4615.43, "timestamp": "01:16:55", "text": "所以你一定要记住这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4618.83, "timestamp": "01:16:58", "text": "那真是令人悲伤的一天。那天下雨。"}]